### Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "Nighttime Parking Lot with Vehicle and Potential Occlusion Risk" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :hasObstacle :obstacle1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1, :risk2 ;
    :description "Vehicle parked in a way that may obscure visibility of pedestrians or other vehicles in a poorly lit parking lot at night." .

:obstacle1 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Parked vehicle partially blocking view of the parking lot exit." .

:weather1 a :NightCondition ;
    :description "Low-light conditions due to nighttime." .

:risk1 a :OcclusionRisk ;
    :description "Parked vehicle obstructing view of potential pedestrians or other vehicles in the parking lot." ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:risk2 a :DistractionRisk ;
    :description "Poor lighting and structural elements (e.g., beams) may distract the driver or reduce situational awareness." ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.60"^^xsd:float .
```

